															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/seereeni" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7039498); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7039498&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606099748" alt="Seereeni" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7039498)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/seereeni" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7039498); return false;" >Seereeni</a></span> <span class="odate time_1606078468 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">22 Nov 2020 20:54</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4825696">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> No</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout:</strong> Standard SCP Article layout</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A blender which mixes together any two ingredients and then produces an ingredient resembling both used ingredients, which also has additional substances not found in any of the used ingredients.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> A field Agent from France comes across rumors of people's ailments being cured after consuming the food at a certain restaurant. Undercover Agents are sent to investigate for any possible anomalies. They come upon SCP-XXXX, and upon further interwieving of the kitchen staff, it turns out the blender simply showed up in a box on their kitchen table one morning.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> The limitless possibilities of mix and mash and see what happens. However, the amount of ingredients used is ever getting higher for producing the same amount of previously resulted mixture.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> My first SCP idea. Not expecting much. Just give it to me. Sandbox draft is half complete, just wanted to see if this idea would even fly first.</p>

							</div>

								
					
